    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Chaitin-Briggs repeats build, simplify and select, with spill code when coloring fails.",
      "narration": "The allocator loops through renumber, build, coalesce, spill costs, simplify and select. If select cannot color a node, spill code is inserted and the loop restarts.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "The pipeline",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "l",
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Renumber live ranges",
            "Build interference graph",
            "Coalesce copies",
            "Compute spill costs",
            "Simplify: push nodes of degree < k",
            "Select: pop and assign a free color"
          ],
          "x": 8,
          "y": 18,
          "w": 84,
          "enter": "slide-up",
          "color": "purple",
          "at": 1300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 9500,
      "caption": "Simplify removes any node with fewer than k neighbors, because it is always colorable later.",
      "narration": "Simplify removes a node with fewer than k neighbors and pushes it on a stack. It is guaranteed a free color later.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "Simplify",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 5,
          "w": 84,
          "at": 0,
          "enter": "fade"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "text",
          "text": "while graph not empty:\n  n = node with degree < k\n  stack.push(n)\n  remove n and its edges\n  if none exists: pick spill\n    candidate (lowest cost/degree)",
          "x": 8,
          "y": 18,
          "w": 84,
          "enter": "slide-up",
          "at": 1300
        },
        {
          "id": "hl",
          "type": "highlight",
          "target": "c",
          "at": 2100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "duration_ms": 12000,
      "caption": "Briggs pushes a spill candidate optimistically, since its neighbors may still share colors.",
      "narration": "If every node has degree k or more, Chaitin spills immediately. Briggs pushes the cheapest candidate anyway, since neighbors may share colors and it may still get one.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "h",
          "type": "title",
